# Jak 1 from boot into a new game on the simulated headset. "PRESS START" is up by about frame 2350 (the logo skips
# only once village1 has loaded); Start opens the title menu, A takes New Game, A the first empty save slot, and the
# opening cutscene starts. Expect panel pictures until then, eye pictures in the cutscene (through Jak's eyes by
# default), and the cutscene seen with the head turned.
2000 shot j1-title
2400 menu 1
2406 menu 0
2650 shot j1-menu
2700 a 1
2706 a 0
2950 shot j1-slots
3000 a 1
3006 a 0
3300 shot j1-scene1
3600 shot j1-scene2
3660 head_yaw 45
3720 shot j1-scene-left
3780 head_yaw 0
4200 shot j1-scene3
4800 shot j1-scene4
4860 quit 0
